# EMBER -- Subsonic/Gonic server
# Copy this file to the root of the SD card as: subsonic.txt
#
# Line 1: server address (Gonic, Navidrome, Airsonic...)
# Line 2: username
# Line 3: password
# Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Default ports vary by server -- Gonic defaults to 4747, Navidrome to 4533.
# Check your server's actual configuration rather than assuming either.
#
# Example for a local Gonic instance:
http://192.168.1.10:4747
my_username
my_password
